    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1749306928\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1749306928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1749306928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Explore a romantic drama inspired by the classic fairy tale &quot;Little Red Riding Hood&quot;. Follow Tsuki Ito, a lonely and traumatized boy. However, his life takes an unexpected turn when he gets lost on his first day and encounters a mysterious girl with a radiant presence. Yet, her true nature will only be unveiled with the first light of the moon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/b0c38a346a2a271e5b1f5e945f8553db.avif?t=1749306928\" width=600 height=268 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/f1cb1c52ca84c9e81a1af3433f106002.avif?t=1749306928\" width=600 height=268 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 hours of immersive content<br></li><li> A dramatic narrative filled with scary moments.<br></li><li> Branching storylines based on your choices.<br></li><li> Multiple possible endings<br></li><li> A drama/horror experience inspired by &quot;Little Red Riding Hood&quot;</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1749306928\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1749306928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1749306928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Explore a romantic drama inspired by the classic fairy tale &quot;Little Red Riding Hood&quot;. Follow Tsuki Ito, a lonely and traumatized boy. However, his life takes an unexpected turn when he gets lost on his first day and encounters a mysterious girl with a radiant presence. Yet, her true nature will only be unveiled with the first light of the moon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/b0c38a346a2a271e5b1f5e945f8553db.avif?t=1749306928\" width=600 height=268 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217740/extras/f1cb1c52ca84c9e81a1af3433f106002.avif?t=1749306928\" width=600 height=268 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 hours of immersive content<br></li><li> A dramatic narrative filled with scary moments.<br></li><li> Branching storylines based on your choices.<br></li><li> Multiple possible endings<br></li><li> A drama/horror experience inspired by &quot;Little Red Riding Hood&quot;</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Alone and lost for falling asleep on the first day of school, the only option left for Tsuki Ito is to trust a peculiar-looking girl with a radiant presence. Follow this story of romance and suspense inspired by the classic tale of &quot;Little Red Riding Hood.&quot;",
